msgstr "저장할 데이터"

#: ../../source/libraries/caching.rst:146
msgid "Time To Live, in seconds (default 60)"
msgstr "유효 시간(TTL), 초 단위 (기본값 60)"

#: ../../source/libraries/caching.rst:147
#: ../../source/libraries/caching.rst:160
