msgstr "올바른 기본 키를 추가하지 않으면 다음 오류가 발생할 수 있습니다::"

#: ../../source/libraries/sessions.rst:637
msgid "Changing Database Group"
msgstr "데이터베이스 그룹 변경"

#: ../../source/libraries/sessions.rst:639
msgid ""
"The default database group is used by default. You can change the database "
"group to use by changing the ``$DBGroup`` property in the "
"**app/Config/Session.php** file to the name of the group to use:"
