#: ../../source/libraries/validation.rst:814
msgid "Allowing Parameters"
msgstr "매개변수 허용"

#: ../../source/libraries/validation.rst:816
msgid ""
"If your method needs to work with parameters, the function will need a "
"minimum of three parameters:"
msgstr "메서드가 매개변수와 함께 작동해야 하는 경우 함수에는 최소 세 개의 매개변수가 필요합니다:"

#: ../../source/libraries/validation.rst:818
