msgid "the parameter string (``$params``)"
msgstr "매개변수 문자열 (``$params``)"

#: ../../source/libraries/validation.rst:820
msgid "an array with all of the data that was submitted the form (``$data``)"
msgstr "폼에서 제출된 모든 데이터가 있는 배열 (``$data``)"

#: ../../source/libraries/validation.rst:821
